Article 5 (Processing by the Head of a Si, Eup, or Myeon) Where the head of a Si (including Special Metropolitan Cities, Metropolitan Cities, and Sis with Gus; in these Rules the expressions "Si", "Mayor", and "city office" shall refer respectively to the Gu, head of the Gu, or Gu office, except that for an integrated urban-rural Si, matters concerning an Eup or Myeon area shall refer to that Eup or Myeon, its head, or its office), Eup, or Myeon receives an application for creation (correction) of a family relationship register, the application shall be processed as follows: <Amended on May 27, 2021; December 29, 2023>
1. Where there is a decision of the Committee directing the creation of a victim's family relationship register, the register shall be created and, concurrently with its creation, the deceased person's register shall be closed;
2. Where the entries in a family relationship register differ from the facts, an entry of correction shall be made only if the discrepancy is apparent from the documents attached to the application for correction.
